- 2026-07-28 (final fix in the Qwen3-VL chain): `gllm/model_loader.py` —
  superseded the narrower `_skip_random_init()`-only patch above with a
  more general fix once a FOURTH independent crash site was found
  (`gllm/layers/linear.py`'s `create_weights()` calling `torch.rand()`
